---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import {categories} from '../data/site';
import {getCollection} from 'astro:content';
const articles=await getCollection('knowledge');
---
<Base title="自动化零部件供应与非标零件服务"><section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">RIBLOXEN / AUTOMATION PARTS SOLUTIONS</p><h1>自动化零部件供应<br/>与<span>非标零件服务</span></h1><p>从标准件选型，到非标件需求对接。<br/>围绕设备的每一处连接，梳理规格、确认需求、协同采购。</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/products/">查看产品 <span>↗</span></a><a class="button secondary" href="/rfq/">获取报价 <span>↗</span></a></div></div><div class="hero-panel"><p class="eyebrow">FROM REQUIREMENT TO SUPPLY</p><h2>一份采购需求<br/>三个服务方向</h2><a class="supply-row" href="/products/"><b>01</b><span>标准零部件</span><small>STANDARD ↗</small></a><a class="supply-row" href="/custom-parts/"><b>02</b><span>非标零件</span><small>CUSTOM ↗</small></a><a class="supply-row" href="/solutions/"><b>03</b><span>采购协同</span><small>SOURCING ↗</small></a></div></div><div class="wrap hero-bottom"><div><small>01 / SELECT</small>按型号与工况整理需求</div><div><small>02 / CONFIRM</small>确认规格、数量与交期</div><div><small>03 / CONNECT</small>对接零部件供应资源</div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">PRODUCT CATEGORIES</p><h2>从所需零部件开始</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/products/">浏览产品中心 ↗</a></div><div class="catalog">{categories.map((c,i)=><a class="category" href={`/products/${c.slug}/`}><div class="category-top"><span>0{i+1}</span><span>↗</span></div><h3>{c.name}</h3><p>{c.desc}</p><small>{c.en}</small><p class="tags">{c.items.join(' / ')}</p></a>)}</div><p class="notice">目录用于说明可沟通的采购方向。具体品牌、型号、供货范围、价格与交期，以需求核实后的报价为准。</p></div></section><section class="section pale"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">TWO WAYS TO START</p><h2>标准采购，或按图沟通</h2></div><p>让每一次询价，都有清晰的起点。</p></div><div class="split"><article class="service"><p class="eyebrow">01 / STANDARD PARTS</p><h3>有型号，按清单确认</h3><p>把零散需求整理成一份可核对的采购清单。</p><ul><li>产品名称、品牌与完整型号</li><li>规格、数量与期望到货时间</li><li>替代型号是否可接受</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/rfq/?type=standard">整理标准件询价 ↗</a></article><article class="service"><p class="eyebrow">02 / CUSTOM PARTS</p><h3>有图纸，逐项确认要求</h3><p>明确材料、尺寸和验收条件，再对接加工资源。</p><ul><li>图纸版本、材料牌号与数量</li><li>关键公差、表面处理与检验要求</li><li>样件需求与交付计划</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/custom-parts/">了解非标零件服务 ↗</a></article></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">A CLEAR PROCUREMENT PROCESS</p><h2>把采购过程说清楚</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/capabilities/">服务与交付 ↗</a></div><div class="steps">{[['需求整理','提供型号清单或非标要求，说明数量与交付时间。'],['规格核对','确认关键尺寸、材料、工况及可接受的替代范围。'],['报价确认','核实供货条件，按实际需求确认价格、交期与验收约定。'],['交付沟通','按已确认订单跟进进度，配合到货与问题反馈。']].map(([h,p],i)=><article class="step"><b>STEP 0{i+1}</b><h3>{h}</h3><p>{p}</p></article>)}</div></div></section><section class="section pale"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">KNOWLEDGE & RESOURCES</p><h2>让需求描述更准确</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/knowledge/">全部技术资料 ↗</a></div><div class="article-grid">{articles.slice(0,3).map(a=><a class="product-card" href={`/knowledge/${a.id}/`}><p class="eyebrow">{a.data.tag}</p><h3>{a.data.title}</h3><p>{a.data.description}</p><span class="text-link">阅读资料 ↗</span></a>)}</div></div></section><section class="cta"><div class="wrap"><div><h2>下一份需求，从这里开始。</h2><p>准备好型号、采购清单，或需要解决的问题。</p></div><a class="button" href="/rfq/">整理询价需求 <span>↗</span></a></div></section></Base>
